cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below (see 'preferred-citation')."
title: "Large Network Generator"
abstract: >-
  A simple, efficient, and flexible random walk-based preferential attachment
  algorithm for generating large complex networks with real-world properties
  (power-law degree distributions, high clustering, and short average path
  lengths). Provides C++ and Python implementations.
type: software
